a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=b582e6c0e2c54a3f8168601c5b292c24&pipelineRunId=c2e651634671429089ee2c8f2085ebbc&projectName=CANN>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/ops-nn/package/3079/cann-ops-nn_linux-aarch64.run>>>>>></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>UT_Test_ophost</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>UT_Test_opapi</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>UT_Test_kernel</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>UT_Test_opgraph</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Smoke_A900_npupool</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/ops-nn/package/3079/slog.tar.gz>>>>>></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>API_Check</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=b582e6c0e2c54a3f8168601c5b292c24&pipelineRunId=c2e651634671429089ee2c8f2085ebbc&projectName=CANN>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> </table><p>[2026-03-23 21:32:11] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CI执行结束 </p>","created_at":"2026-03-23T21:25:27+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-23T21:32:12+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166296036,"discussion_id":"f303b1df8ee7db04028e4ba55365dcdc021af456","body":"## Code Review 意见\n\n### 1. blockLen 向上对齐修改 (第374行)\n\n**修改内容:**\n```diff\n- dataCopyParams.blockLen = curAicN * sizeof(yType) / DATA_BLOCK;\n+ dataCopyParams.blockLen = DequantBmm::CeilDiv(curAicN * sizeof(yType), DATA_BLOCK);\n```\n\n**分析:** ✅ 修复正确\n\n这是一个必要的修复。原代码使用整数除法，当 `curAicN * sizeof(yType)` 不是 `DATA_BLOCK` 的整数倍时会导致数据丢失。\n\n**示例:** 假设 `DATA_BLOCK = 32`, `curAicN = 10`, `sizeof(yType) = 2` (half)\n- 原代码: `blockLen = 20 / 32 = 0` (数据丢失)\n- 新代码: `blockLen = CeilDiv(20, 32) = 1` (正确)\n\n**建议:** \n- ✅ 修复逻辑正确\n- ❓ 请确认 `DequantBmm::CeilDiv` 实现是否正确处理边界情况\n- ❓ `dstStride` 计算仍使用整数除法，是否需要同步修改为 `CeilDiv`?\n\n---\n\n### 2. AllocTensor 内存管理修改 (第403-442行)\n\n**修改内容:**\n将 `AllocTensor` 从循环外移入循环内，每次循环独立分配和释放内存。\n\n**分析:** ✅ 修复正确\n\n原代码问题:\n1. 在循环外分配一次内存\n2. 在循环内多次执行 `EnQue -> DeQue`\n3. AscendC Queue 语义要求每次 EnQue 和 DeQue 配对使用\n4. 多次循环重复使用同一块内存可能导致队列状态混乱\n\n新代码优点:\n1. 每次循环独立分配和释放内存\n2. 内存管理逻辑清晰\n3. 符合 AscendC Queue 的使用规范\n\n**建议:**\n- ✅ 修复逻辑正确，解决了内存管理问题\n- ⚠️ 性能考虑: 每次循环重新 AllocTensor 可能有轻微性能开销，但相比正确性更重要\n- ✅ FreeTensor 在循环内释放是正确的\n\n---\n\n### 总体评价\n\n**修复正确性:** ✅ 通过\n- 两个修复都解决了实际问题\n- 代码逻辑清晰，符合 AscendC 开发规范\n\n**测试验证:**\n- CI 编译测试已通过 ✅\n- 建议在合并前验证:\n  1. 尾块不对齐场景的功能正确性\n  2. 多次循环场景的内存管理正确性\n  3. 性能回归测试\n\n**代码质量:** ✅ 良好\n- 修复了关键的 bug\n- 代码风格一致\n- 注释可以更详细说明修复原因","created_at":"2026-03-25T09:11:09+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T09:12:49+08:00","user":{"id":"67bc507715854d2cf374d07b","login":"chenfeng61","object_id":"67bc507715854d2cf374d07b","name":"chenfeng","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fe/db/3489fe7592308db8936c9f9383eb8bc37a9ddd3e3bcda7afba6d1c99d3829996.png","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/chenfeng61"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"67bc507715854d2cf374d07b","login":"chenfeng61","object_id":"67bc507715854d2cf374d07b","name":"chenfeng","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fe/db/3489fe7592308db8936c9f9383eb8bc37a9ddd3e3bcda7afba6d1c99d3829996.png","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/chenfeng61"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":377,"end_new_line":377,"start_old_line":377,"end_old_line":377,"position_type":"text"},"reply":[{"id":166446889,"body":"changed this line on [76a59165](https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-nn/commits/detail/76a59165411b5fd845ec42a35de334c5d2b115ef?ref=master&prId=3079) view [diff detail](https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-nn/merge_requests/3079/diffs?diffId=5683284&start_sha=1aad1b2e011c1541b90d33a198a6540be78880c2&filePath=matmul/fused_quant_mat_mul/op_kernel/fused_quant_mat_mul_swiglu.h#31f4b86cd4f4db1e2010b322e99e1bfb6dda542e_377_377)","created_at":"2026-03-26T11:24:06+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-26T11:24:06+08:00","user":{"id":"685edd52543b5b402352370e","login":"yanjiang-treasure","object_id":"685edd52543b5b402352370e","name":"Jacob","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/yanjiang-treasure"}}]},{"id":166296090,"discussion_id":"1c8fbe5bc3fff66f226ddf04c75cea86f2d787dd","body":"**✅ 正确的内存管理修改**\n\n将 `AllocTensor` 移入循环内是正确的修复。原代码在循环外分配一次内存后，在循环内多次执行 `EnQue -> DeQue`，这不符合 AscendC Queue 的使用规范，可能导致:\n\n1. **队列状态混乱**: 重复入队同一块内存可能导致队列内部状态不一致\n2. **内存访问错误**: 后续循环可能访问到已被释放或覆盖的内存\n3. **数据竞争**: 并发场景下可能导致数据竞争\n\n**修改后:**\n- 每次循环独立分配内存\n- `EnQue -> DeQue -> 使用 -> FreeTensor` 形成完整的生命周期\n- 符合 AscendC Queue 的最佳实践\n\n**性能影响:** 虽然每次循环重新分配内存有轻微开销，但保证了正确性。如果性能敏感，可考虑使用双缓冲（Double Buffer）技术。","created_at":"2026-03-25T09:11:36+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T09:13:12+08:00","user":{"id":"67bc507715854d2cf374d07b","login":"chenfeng61","object_id":"67bc507715854d2cf374d07b","name":"chenfeng","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fe/db/3489fe7592308db8936c9f9383eb8bc37a9ddd3e3bcda7afba6d1c99d3829996.png","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/chenfeng61"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"67bc507715854d2cf374d07b","login":"chenfeng61","object_id":"67bc507715854d2cf374d07b","name":"chenfeng","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fe/db/3489fe7592308db8936c9f9383eb8bc37a9ddd3e3bcda7afba6d1c99d3829996.png","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/chenfeng61"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":414,"end_new_line":414,"start_old_line":416,"end_old_line":416,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":166296099,"discussion_id":"dde0f9228db43f26be69a04279d480b8429d5410","body":"**✅ FreeTensor 位置正确**\n\n将 `FreeTensor` 放在循环内释放是正确的。\n\n**内存生命周期:**\n```\nfor (nInnerIdx = 0; ...) {\n    AllocTensor()    // 分配\n    EnQue()          // 入队\n    DeQue()          // 出队\n    ... 使用内存 ...\n    FreeTensor()     // 释放\n}\n```\n\n这种模式确保:\n1. 每次迭代有独立的内存空间\n2. 内存及时释放，避免资源泄漏\n3. 符合 AscendC Queue 的 RAII 模式\n\n**对比原代码:**\n- 原代码在循环外 FreeTensor，如果循环中途出现异常或提前退出，可能导致内存泄漏\n- 新代码确保每次迭代的内存都能正确释放","created_at":"2026-03-25T09:11:47+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T09:13:49+08:00","user":{"id":"67bc507715854d2cf374d07b","login":"chenfeng61","object_id":"67bc507715854d2cf374d07b","name":"chenfeng","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fe/db/3489fe7592308db8936c9f9383eb8bc37a9ddd3e3bcda7afba6d1c99d3829996.png","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/chenfeng61"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"67bc507715854d2cf374d07b","login":"chenfeng61","object_id":"67bc507715854d2cf374d07b","name":"chenfeng","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fe/db/3489fe7592308db8936c9f9383eb8bc37a9ddd3e3bcda7afba6d1c99d3829996.png","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/chenfeng61"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":447,"end_new_line":447,"start_old_line":445,"end_old_line":445,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":166296123,"discussion_id":"de81d986f71ed4dcc524bd1bd5e4392c4deede82","body":"## 总体评价\n\n这个 PR 修复了两个关键问题:\n\n### ✅ 修复1: blockLen 尾块对齐\n- **问题**: 整数除法导致尾块数据丢失\n- **修复**: 使用 `CeilDiv` 向上对齐\n- **评估**: 修复正确，解决了数据丢失 bug\n\n### ✅ 修复2: AllocTensor 内存管理\n- **问题**: 循环外分配，循环内重复 EnQue/DeQue 导致队列状态混乱\n- **修复**: 移入循环内，每次独立分配和释放\n- **评估**: 修复正确，符合 AscendC Queue 使用规范\n\n### ⚠️ 待确认事项\n\n1. **dstStride 计算** (第379行)\n   - 仍使用整数除法，建议确认是否需要同步修改\n   - 或说明为什么这里不需要向上对齐\n\n2. **性能影响**\n   - 每次循环重新 AllocTensor 可能有性能开销\n   - 建议进行性能回归测试\n   - 如有性能要求，可考虑双缓冲优化\n\n### \uD83D\uDCCB 建议的测试验证\n\n1. **尾块不对齐场景**\n   - 构造 `curAicN * sizeof(yType)` 不是 `DATA_BLOCK` 整数倍的测试用例\n   - 验证数据搬出正确性\n\n2. **多次循环场景**\n   - 构造 `nInnerLoops > 1` 的测试用例\n   - 验证内存管理正确性，无内存泄漏\n\n3. **性能回归测试**\n   - 对比修改前后的性能\n   - 确认性能可接受\n\n### \uD83C\uDFAF 结论\n\n**建议合并**，但需要:\n1. 确认 dstStride 计算是否需要修改\n2. 完成建议的测试验证\n3. 性能回归测试通过\n\n代码质量良好，修复了关键 bug，符合 AscendC 开发规范。","created_at":"2026-03-25T09:12:04+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T09:12:04+08:00","user":{"id":"67bc507715854d2cf374d07b","login":"chenfeng61","object_id":"67bc507715854d2cf374d07b","name":"chenfeng","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fe/db/3489fe7592308db8936c9f9383eb8bc37a9ddd3e3bcda7afba6d1c99d3829996.png","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/chenfeng61"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166446927,"discussion_id":"9ea326fa25254f0ac09b830b4bd18b0f535810d9","body":"### Notification  \nThis pull request source branch has changed, so removes the following label(s): ci-pipeline-passed.","created_at":"2026-03-26T11:24:15+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-26T11:24:15+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.co